        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Touch Grass: A Bit-Sized Christmas Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s Christmas Eve 2001, the snow is falling, and you and your friends have one mission: <strong>earn enough cash before bedtime to finally buy the newly released <i>GameStation 2</i>.</strong><br>How? By doing what any self-respecting kid would do: <strong>Go door to door across the neighborhood and blast Christmas carols </strong>for donations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎄 A Tiny Town, a Big Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/2c013e7fc93cd8c90abdeb08547f9b37.poster.avif?t=1766673047\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/2c013e7fc93cd8c90abdeb08547f9b37.webm?t=1766673047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/2c013e7fc93cd8c90abdeb08547f9b37.mp4?t=1766673047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a cozy, 2D pixel-art town filled with quirky characters, Christmas vibes, and secrets tucked behind every snowman. You’ve only got one day, so hustle! Visit houses, play music, talk to NPCs, complete quests, and upgrade your musical gear to impress your audience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎶 Play Carols, Hit Beats, Earn Cash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/3f372fcef747cee38050057774b4e98c.poster.avif?t=1766673047\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/3f372fcef747cee38050057774b4e98c.webm?t=1766673047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/3f372fcef747cee38050057774b4e98c.mp4?t=1766673047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform a set of classic holiday tunes with your keytar through a <strong>quick-time rhythm mini-game</strong>. <br>Time your notes, build long streaks, and squeeze every coin out of your festive performances.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Visit the Arcade &amp; Master <i>Boxerino</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/30fb21eec7f334d530cbcc69585ea75b.poster.avif?t=1766673047\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/30fb21eec7f334d530cbcc69585ea75b.webm?t=1766673047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/30fb21eec7f334d530cbcc69585ea75b.mp4?t=1766673047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from caroling at the local arcade and try <strong>Boxerino</strong>, a sokoban-inspired puzzle-action minigame. Dash, punch and smash your way through endless piles of boxes to get the highest score possible in this retro-inspired game. It’s a whole game within the game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> ☃️ Snowball Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/ddf5754b68c8fa20433931d8096ca74c.poster.avif?t=1766673047\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/ddf5754b68c8fa20433931d8096ca74c.webm?t=1766673047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/ddf5754b68c8fa20433931d8096ca74c.mp4?t=1766673047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into team-based <strong>snowball fights</strong> against rival kids, putting your hard-earned cash on the line. Dodge, throw, and outplay your opponents in lighthearted winter skirmishes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >❄️<strong>A Bit-Sized Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be completed in a couple of sessions, this short-but-sweet experience captures the charm of retro holiday specials with a sprinkle of slapstick comedy, pixel graphics, and warm nostalgia.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❄️ <strong>Charming top-down 2D pixel-art town</strong> with a cozy Christmas atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 <strong>Rhythm-based performances</strong> with quick-time events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ <strong>Explore, talk, collect, and upgrade</strong> during your single-day adventure<strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Play <i>Boxerino</i></strong>, a sokoban-style arcade challenge with an action twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎨 Snowball Fights</strong> against rival squads with risk-and-reward cash stakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ <strong>Score attack &amp; time-limited exploration</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧑‍🤝‍🧑 <strong>Singleplayer story</strong> full of humor and holiday cheer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎁 <strong>A compact, 1-hour festive journey</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Touch Grass: A Bit-Sized Christmas Adventure</strong> is a small, heartfelt, and silly holiday escape—perfect for players who love retro charm, rhythm challenges, and short games packed with personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to earn that GameStation 2? 🎮✨</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Touch Grass: A Bit-Sized Christmas Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s Christmas Eve 2001, the snow is falling, and you and your friends have one mission: <strong>earn enough cash before bedtime to finally buy the newly released <i>GameStation 2</i>.</strong><br>How? By doing what any self-respecting kid would do: <strong>Go door to door across the neighborhood and blast Christmas carols </strong>for donations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎄 A Tiny Town, a Big Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/2c013e7fc93cd8c90abdeb08547f9b37.poster.avif?t=1766673047\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/2c013e7fc93cd8c90abdeb08547f9b37.webm?t=1766673047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/2c013e7fc93cd8c90abdeb08547f9b37.mp4?t=1766673047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a cozy, 2D pixel-art town filled with quirky characters, Christmas vibes, and secrets tucked behind every snowman. You’ve only got one day, so hustle! Visit houses, play music, talk to NPCs, complete quests, and upgrade your musical gear to impress your audience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎶 Play Carols, Hit Beats, Earn Cash</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/3f372fcef747cee38050057774b4e98c.poster.avif?t=1766673047\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/3f372fcef747cee38050057774b