3931d8096ca74c.webm?t=1766673047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228550/extras/ddf5754b68c8fa20433931d8096ca74c.mp4?t=1766673047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into team-based <strong>snowball fights</strong> against rival kids, putting your hard-earned cash on the line. Dodge, throw, and outplay your opponents in lighthearted winter skirmishes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >❄️<strong>A Bit-Sized Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be completed in a couple of sessions, this short-but-sweet experience captures the charm of retro holiday specials with a sprinkle of slapstick comedy, pixel graphics, and warm nostalgia.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >❄️ <strong>Charming top-down 2D pixel-art town</strong> with a cozy Christmas atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 <strong>Rhythm-based performances</strong> with quick-time events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ <strong>Explore, talk, collect, and upgrade</strong> during your single-day adventure<strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Play <i>Boxerino</i></strong>, a sokoban-style arcade challenge with an action twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🎨 Snowball Fights</strong> against rival squads with risk-and-reward cash stakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ <strong>Score attack &amp; time-limited exploration</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧑‍🤝‍🧑 <strong>Singleplayer story</strong> full of humor and holiday cheer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎁 <strong>A compact, 1-hour festive journey</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Touch Grass: A Bit-Sized Christmas Adventure</strong> is a small, heartfelt, and silly holiday escape—perfect for players who love retro charm, rhythm challenges, and short games packed with personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to earn that GameStation 2? 🎮✨</p>",
